{
  "bookId": "hero-214020",
  "id": "bond-38802",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38802001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "助手，你终于取材回来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "奥莉安娜一直在等我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "今天开始，有个任务要交给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "喏，这个镜头的擦拭，以后就是助手最重要的每日任务了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看上去很贵重，交给我真的可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "当然可以，只有我认可的助手才能完成这项任务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过这个镜头有什么特殊之处吗，居然每天都要擦拭？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "哼~很会提问啊，是反过来想采访我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "这是助手专属的镜头。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我专属的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "是我专门用来拍你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "原来是这个「专属」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "拍摄新闻是追逐真相的过程，我很喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38802014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "毕竟，现在对我来说，你的“真相”还远远不够呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
